            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Ko 3",
            "review_text": "burrston\nSan Francisco, California73 contributions\n0\nGreat value for quality Japanese food\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nRead about Sushi Ko on an ex-pat foodie blog. I decided to try since it was near my hotel and I was not disappointed. This is excellent quality sushi at a bargain price. You can spend more for lesser quality. I enjoyed a sashimi combo, gyoza, seaweed salad, and small carafe of sake for 350k VND (15 USD). I returned a couple days later for the lunch special cold soba with tempura and sushi roll - 200 VND with beer.\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2020",
